  m_text: "Grows in the mushroom grove right after the dragon skeleton cave\u2014Day
    2. Still part of the Cave, but quieter. Glowing caps, twisty stems. For some
    reason, eating those makes you feel taller. After all those bones and ash, this
    spot feels\u2026 almost safe..."
